es/93683\r\n\r\nThis PR simplifies and fixes a few functions of struct `Projection` :\r\n- Fix `get_aspect()` and `get_lod_multiplier()` with camera in `PROJECTION_FRUSTUM mode. The latter now has a uniform behavior no matter the camera mode (perspective, frustum and orthographic). Besides it was broken in frustum mode, it also used to decimate meshes twice slower in orthographic than in perspective mode.\r\n- Fix and document `get_pixels_per_meter()`. **Note** : this function has a clumsy definition and is not used anywhere. It's a good candidate for deprecation.\r\n- Optimize `get_z_far()`, `get_z_near()`, `get_viewport_half_extents()`, `get_far_plane_half_extents()` and `get_fov()`\r\n- Add (more) unit test to the above functions\r\n\r\nTest project for LOD multiplier issues : [lod.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18065186/lod.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://av